# Exact OPAM closure of the CI-only API documentation tool (`make docs`).
#
# Format: <package> <exact version>
#
# Dockerfile.dev's `docs` stage installs these packages on top of the locked
# SDK closure and fails if any installed version differs. They are build tools
# for rendering documentation only: no package here is a dependency of
# temporal-sdk, is linked into any SDK library or executable, or is
# redistributed. Packages already pinned by temporal-sdk.opam.locked (dune,
# ocamlfind, ocamlbuild, topkg) are reused at their locked versions and are not
# repeated here. The closure was solved for the OCaml 5.2 image that runs
# `make docs`; see docs/reference/quality-gates.md for the licence review.
astring 0.8.5
camlp-streams 5.0.1
cmdliner 2.1.1
cppo 1.8.0
crunch 4.0.0
fmt 0.11.0
fpath 0.7.3
odoc 3.2.1
odoc-parser 3.2.1
ptime 1.2.0
re 1.14.0
seq base
tyxml 4.6.0
uutf 1.0.4
